# Daytime watchdog for the automation layer itself: flags installed cron
# jobs with no finished run within their cadence (a job whose LaunchAgent
# silently stopped firing never reports a failure — this catches the
# silence). Runs at 10:00 when the machine is certainly awake. A stale job
# prints an SD_REPORT_ATTENTION line, so the run's report reaches Reports
# and Today.
JOB_SCHEDULE="0 10 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="sh \"$ROOT/../local-cron-jobs/cron-jobs.sh\" watchdog"
